{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51696","headline":"咏志（《全唐诗》七九五只存前二句） · 屠环智","name":"咏志（《全唐诗》七九五只存前二句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻身都是义，殉主始爲忠。\n一夜西陵路，朱旗走大风。\n（《全五代诗》七三引《槜李诗系》）（〖1〗此说未允。\n《全唐文》卷八九八收皮光业《屠将军墓志铭》、《十国春秋》卷八四皆作屠瓌智。\n〖2〗见《槜李诗系》卷一，作者作屠瓌智。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"屠环智","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}